name="marionnet"
description="A virtual network laboratory"
# --- The publication series opened by the dune port. The patch level is NOT written here:
# --- it is derived from the VCS as (revision - series_base_revision), by the single
# --- implementation of that rule, `bin/meta.ml.maker.sh --print-version'. So `1.0.x' is the
# --- series and `1.0.368' is what a build of revision 942 calls itself.
version="1.0.x"
# --- The last revision BEFORE this series (r574 = the last commit before the dune port,
# --- whose first commit is therefore 1.0.1). It moves the day a new series opens, and it is
# --- what makes the patch level count the revisions OF THE SERIES rather than the 574
# --- revisions the 0.90.x and 0.98.x series had already spent.
series_base_revision="574"
requires="threads str unix lablgtk3 lablglade ocamlbricks"
